### 查询 V1 发货标签
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-direct-fulfillment/shipping/v1/shipping-labels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"createdAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z"}}

### 提交 V1 发货标签请求
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-direct-fulfillment/shipping/v1/shipping-labels/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"shippingLabelRequests":[]}}

### 查询 V1 发货标签详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-direct-fulfillment/shipping/v1/shipping-labels/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"purchaseOrderNumber":"PO-1"}}

### 提交 V1 发货确认
